<title>SINGAPORE: Avimo closes Penang unit.</title>
<headline>Avimo closes Penang unit.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1996-11-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Defence equipment group Avimo Group Ltd announced on Monday its Penang subsidiary would cease trading immediately.</p>
<p>The company said in a statement the business of Penang Avimo Malaysia Sdn Bhd would be transferred to its Singapore facility, which is being expanded following the acquisition of a factory.</p>
<p>Avimo said the cost of the closure and net proceeds expected from the disposal of the Penang property were expected to be small and would be provided for as an extraordinary item for year ending September 30, 1996.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65 8703080)</p>
</text>
